      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "How about a leisurely stroll every now\r\nand then? I've heard that the\r\narea around the \"Camp\" at\r\n[<SPOT 876>] in \r\n[<AREA 14>] is perfect\r\nfor walking. I believe taking\r\na commemorative photo together\r\nwould make for great memories.",
        "Jp" : "たまには、のんびりお散歩でもいかがでしょう？\r\n《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 876>》にある\r\n\"キャンプ\"の辺りは散歩にぴったりだと聞きました\r\n共に記念撮影すれば、良い思い出になると思うのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542402,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
