      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master, training outdoors can be quite\r\nrefreshing. Yes, let's race to\r\n[<SPOT 876>] in \r\n[<AREA 14>]! Once we\r\narrive, I'd like to take a\r\nphoto in front of the \"Camp\" as a\r\nkeepsake!",
        "Jp" : "マスター、屋外での鍛錬も気持ちの良いものですよ\r\nそうです、《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 876>》まで\r\n競争しましょう！\r\n着いたら、記念に\"キャンプ\"の前で\r\n写真を撮りたいですね！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542426,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
