      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Master, I think a relaxing walk now and then\r\nis delightful. The scenery at \r\n[<SPOT 876>]\r\nin [<AREA 14>] should be\r\nquite lovely. Perhaps we could\r\npreserve a memory of our daily lives,\r\naway from the fight, in front of the \"Camp\"?",
        "Jp" : "覚者殿、たまにはのんびり散歩も良いものですよ\r\n《<AREA 14>》の《<SPOT 876>》の光景が\r\n中々のものかと――\r\n\"キャンプ\"の前にて戦いから離れた日常の\r\n一枚を残してみても良いのでは？"
      },
